BT /F1 9 Tf 50 421 Td (strict separation of syntactic/semantic normalization from clinical rule adjudication. In) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 407 Td (conventional LLM-as-a-Judge pipelines, a single autoregressive language model is tasked) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 393 Td (simultaneously with reading the clinical response, inferring what clinical actions were) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 379 Td (proposed or withheld, recalling clinical practice guidelines, and rendering a holistic) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 365 Td (safety verdict \(PASS or FAIL\). This conflation of parsing and reasoning makes the evaluator) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 351 Td (vulnerable to stylistic persuasion: when a subject model writes in authoritative clinical) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 337 Td (prose, the neural judge's attention mechanism weights surface-level medical fluency over the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 323 Td (silent absence of a single life-saving action.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 309 Td () Tj ET
