BT /F1 9 Tf 50 113 Td (A pure-Python symbolic verification engine takes the verified canonical trace T and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 99 Td (evaluates it deterministically against case-specific clinical safety specifications G_c.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 85 Td (Because Stage II contains zero neural parameters, its safety verdicts are 100% reproducible,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 71 Td (mathematically transparent, and immune to prompt injection or surface fluency.) Tj ET
