BT /F1 9 Tf 50 631 Td (#### Layer 2: Temporal Prerequisite Ordering Engine \(V_temp\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 617 Td (In emergency medicine, performing the right action at the wrong sequence point can be fatal) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 603 Td (\(e.g., discharging a patient before serial troponin results return and are reviewed, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 589 Td (administering beta-blockers in acute aortic dissection before vasodilator/heart-rate) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 575 Td (sequence constraints\). For any proposed action a in P\(T\), let idx_T\(a\) denote the first) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 561 Td (chronological step at which a is proposed. For every prerequisite rule \(a_target, a_req\) in) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 547 Td (Pi_pre\(c\), Layer 2 flags a temporal violation if a_target is proposed without a_req having) Tj ET
